   "command_rule": "a command of r times the reference's speed plays the track r times faster than real time (the reference clock's rate r, the phase-rate term's +-5 % about it): cadence, speed and yaw rate times r, stride and footprints unchanged, the reference rates times r and accelerations times r^2 in the servo targets and the armature feedforward, the reference DCM c + r c' / omega0 (the CoM moving r times as fast), the inverse-dynamics torque and the reference ZMP as the reference's",
